      365.53,
      547.34,
      432.52
    ],
    "text": "I, Ponnuthurai Kuganathan, Returning Officer of the Poonakary Pradeshiya Sabha, under paragraph (b) of Sub section (1) ofSection 10A of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262), do hereby declare that Mr. Perampalam Veluppillai,who contested at the Election for Poonakary Pradeshiya Sabha, held on 23rd July 2011 as a candidate on the Nomination Paperof the Tamil United Liberation Front, has forfeited his rights to have his name retained in the nomination paper of thatrecognized political party, for filling any casual vacancy, by reason of him ceasing to be member of that recognized politicalparty.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
